2 CONT    1 -- + Sawatzky, Abraham Cornelius (#3785) 9 April 1807, Ohrloff, Molotschna, South Russia
2 CONT    2 -- + Sawatzky, Margaretha (#3858) 18 July 1808, Ohrloff, Molotschna, South Russia
2 CONT    3 -- + Sawatzky, Anna (#3859) 17 September 1809, Ohrloff, Molotschna, South Russia
2 CONT    4 --    Sawatzky, Peter (#437392) About 1812, Ohrloff, Molotschna, South Russia
2 CONT    5 -- + Sawatzky, Sara (#3860) 11 March 1816, Ohrloff, Molotschna, South Russia
2 CONT    6 -- + Sawatzky, Peter (#3861) 5 September 1828, Ohrloff, Molotschna, South Russia
2 CONT Notes:	
2 CONT Note: In the 1808 Molotschna Colony Census he is listed at Ohrloff #3 and is said to have come from Heubuden, Prussia (B. H. Unruh, p. 324). However, the migration list (Unruh, p. 352) says that he came in 1804 from Ellerwald, 4th
2 CONC . Trift, Prussia. Also listed as migrating with him was his sister #46489. JMH says that he was married in 1805. He was listed at Ohrloff #3 in 1815 at the time of the birth of his daughter Sara per the 1815-1816 Molotschna Colony
2 CONC  Vital Records. In the 1835 Census he is listed at Ohrloff #3, where it says he came to Russia in 1804.
2 CONT ======
2 CONT Cornelius Thomas Sawatzky 
2 CONT #3857     Birth:	23 SEP 1781,  Heubuden, Gross Werder, Prussia Death:	7 DEC 1840,  Ohrloff, Molotschna, South Russia Father:	 Sawatzky, Thomas,  #100953,  Prussia Mother:	 _?_, Anna,  #197175, 1735  Family 1: Family 2320 	Spouse: 
2 CONC  von Riesen, Anna,  #3595, 12 AUG 1785,  Prussia Married: 25 JAN 1806,  Ohrloff, Molotschna, South Russia  1 -- +  Sawatzky, Abraham Cornelius,  #3785, 9 APR 1807,  Ohrloff, Molotschna, South Russia 2 -- +  Sawatzky, Margaretha,  
