2 CONT
2 CONT Hans "Peter" Doll was born circa 1612. This information is suggested by his 1689 death record, in which Peter Doll was 77 years old.[1] A birth or baptismal record has not been located. The first name "Hannss" is suggested by his 
2 CONC eldest son's baptismal record.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT The mother of Peter Doll's children was a woman named Agnes or Agnesen. She is found in the Evangelisch (protestant) baptismal records of the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannss Peter Doll, baptized on May 30, 1647.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabetha Margretha Doll, baptized on October 3, 1652.[4] 
