1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jacob Shirey, a schoolteacher, was born 1770/1775 in Ireland. It is not stated if he came to America with Beavis at the time of his emigration or not, but it is likely 1. It is not surprising to find the Shirey's i
2 CONC n Virginia. May Irish families came up that valley from Maryland to Virginia before 1800. Probably in the Shenandoah Valley of Virginia, Jacob was married to Elizabeth (last name not known) between 1795 and 1800. Elizabeth was bor
2 CONC n in England 1770/1780. The couple's two eldest children, Jacob, Jr. and Ann (wo married John Aldaffer), were born in Virginia. After 1790 and before 1800, Jacob and Elizabeth move to an unknown county in South Carolina. By 1820 t
2 CONC hey were residing in Richland County, S.C. (near Columbia). Eight Children were born to them while they lived in South Carolina
2 CONT --------------------
