1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  William N. Shirey was a stone mason by trade.  Fought in the Civil war 1861 to 1865.  Confederate side. Private in 46th Regiment Georgia Infantry Company 
2 CONT * The dad is William N. Shirey, the older brother is Augustus, who was only 17 when he went to war. After their deaths William Thomas' mom worked in the turpentine mills to support them, and the last record I found of her was in M
2 CONC ississippi. William Thomas immigrated to Texas after that.
