1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I was born in Erzweiler, but married a girl from Tahllichtenburg, Germany and moved there and that is where we had our family. I married Maria Margaratha Braun on February 13, 1697.  We sailed for America with our 
2 CONC children in 1739 on the ship Samuel. 
2 CONT --------------------
