2 CONC age 281 Notes:  In the 1776 W. Prussia Census he is listed in Altendorf with 1 son and 1 daughter (H. Penner, p. 444). He was a member of the Tiegenhagen Gemeinde. He migrated to Neuendorf, Chortitza, S. Russia in 1795 (P. Rempel,
