2 CONT === Death & Legacy ===
2 CONT Johann passed away in 1837. ≤ref>Death Source: Mennonite Heritage Archives., page Volume 6392, Family Registers from Janet Beaudin 15 Feb 2022 ≤/ref> ≤ref>Death Source: Rosenthal: The Old Colony Russia - The First Settlers: 1788-1
