2 CONT
2 CONT == Research Notes ==
2 CONT Note: He was from Zeiersche Kamp (Zeyersvorderkampen) at the time of his baptism. 
2 CONT He migrated from Ellerwald, Prussia to Russia in 1794 with his father (B. H. Unruh, p. 258; P. Rempel, p. 49). 
2 CONT
2 CONT In the 1801 Chortitza Colony Census he is listed at Einlage #41 and 
2 CONT in the 1808 Census at Einlage #41 (B. H. Unruh, p. 258). In the Oct 1816 Census he is listed at Neu Osterwick #8, where his ageis incorrectly given as 36. 
2 CONT
2 CONT MHA record says he was born 1772 and died 10 Jun 1837.
2 CONT
