2 CONT === Death & Legacy ===
2 CONT Susanna passed away in 1863. ≤ref> Bergthal Gemeinde Buch, Dyck, John,1922; editor, Hanover-Steinbach Historical Society, Box 1960, Steinbach MB, 1993, p. 68. ≤/ref> ≤ref> Riediger, Hilda (Submission to GRANDMA Project by Hilda Ri
