2 CONT
2 CONT == Research Notes ==
2 CONT Notes:  Date of birth is from Schapansky's The Old Colony (Chortitza) of Russia. 
2 CONT The "Genealogy of the Bergen Family" M. Neufeld, 1979 - Friesen Printers, Altona, gives her death date as 3 Mar 1863.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: One record calls her "Susanna Sawatzky." 
2 CONT The Bergthal Gemeinde Buch (Steinbach: Hanover Steinbach Historical Society, 1993), p. 37, gives a different set of parents for Susanna. 
2 CONT The "Genealogy of the Bergen Family" M. Neufeld, 1979 - Friesen Printers, Altona, gives her death date as 3 Mar 1863.
2 CONT Note: The Bergthal Gemeinde Buch, p. A68, says they were married 29 Sep 1822. 
2 CONT The 1822 Chortitza Colony Vital Records say that they were married 1 Oct 1822.
2 CONT
