2 CONT == Biography ==Notes:  In the 1835 Chortitza Colony Census he was listed at with his father at Einlage #39. He apparently moved to Schoenthal, Bergthal Colony with the first settlers of that village about 1837 since he and his fam
2 CONC ily are among a group of Mennonites who expressed a desire to settle in Schoenthal per Odessa Archive, Fond 6, Inventory 1, File 4889. He was a minister.
