2 CONT 	 Note: One record says he was born 23 Nov 1830. Hoffnungsau I p. 379: "Toews Gemeinde gehoerend". He traveled ot Russia May 1894 with Martin Doerksen #4088, Gerhard Doerksen #61433, and Dietrich Friesen #50940. All four men recei
2 CONC ved citizenship before departing. Bethel Inman I p. 185: "1882 Eingeschrieben". Bethel Inman I p. 231: "Uebergeschrieben 1891". His age is given as 46 on the ship passenger list in 1877, which is apprently incorrect. 5 daughters w
2 CONC ith Maria Bolt died in infancy. One source says that he was born in Sparrau, but that village wasn't established until 1828. Turpin p. 24 gives a birth date of 11 Nov 1827.
