2 CONC  His n.s. birthdate was 1 April. He had 12 children with Katharina Reimer, 9 sons and 3 daughters. 3 sons died in childhood. After wife, Katharina died, Gerhard and the children moved to Davlekanova, Ufa about in 1900. They had 12
