2 CONT Notes:	
2 CONT Note: His n.s. birth date was 1 Aug 1818.
2 CONT Note: On the 1852 and 1859 Registers of persons living outside Chortitza, Peter owned and had taken over a farm in the village of Bergthal, Bergthal since 1852. He is listed with the family of his father Bernd Wiebe at No. 4 in Ne
2 CONC uhorst on the 9th Revision List (1850 census). He is listed with the family of his deceased father Bernd Wiebe at No. 8 in Neuhorst on the 10th Revision List (1858 census).
2 CONT Note: Called To Deacon Service in Bergthal Church. Lived in Bergthal village in East Reserve when first in Manitoba
