1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT The Life Summary of Cornelius S. When Cornelius S. Harms was born on 26 August 1835, in Molotschna, Taurida, Russian Empire, his father, Isaac Johann Harms, was 24 and his mother, Anna Sawatsky, was 25. He married Katharina P Thie
2 CONC ssen on 14 August 1856, in Molotschna, Taurida, Russian Empire. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 2 daughters. He lived in Marquette, Woodlands, Manitoba, Canada in 1881. He died on 9 December 1928, in Reedley, Fresno, C
2 CONC alifornia, United States, at the age of 93, and was buried in Zion Krimmer Mennonite Brethren Church Cemetery, Dinuba, Tulare, California, United States.
2 CONT
2 CONT Cornelius Harms
2 CONT
2 CONT BIRTH	26 Aug 1835 born: Blumstein, Molotschna, South Russia 
