1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I was bornin Ulmet Parish, Erzweiler Germany and married to Johan Peter Mumbauer on June 12, 1727 at the Ulmet Reformed Lutheran Church.  In 1739, we sailed with my parents on the ship "Samuel" for America and into
2 CONC  Pennsylvania.  Our three small sons were with us. Unfortunately, my father died on the voyage and was buried at sea.
