2 CONT I was born and baptized at Ulmet Parish in Erzweiler, Germany.  In 1737, I sailed for America and got to Pennsylvania on August 30 on the ship "Samuel"  .  I am listed in Pennsylvania German Pioneers Immigration and Naturalization
2 CONC  at age 24.  I took the Oath of Allegiance in Philadelphia along with my brother Christian on August 30,1737 when we landed. I was a schoolmaster by trade.
