1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I was born and baptized in Ulmet Parish, Erzweiler, Germany on May 8,1725 at the Ulmet Reformed Church.  I was fourteen when my family came to America on the ship "Samuel". I married Margaret in Plainfield Township
2 CONC , Pennsylvania and our daughter Susanna was born there September 24, 1759. We left Pennsylvania in 1770 and settled near the Wachovia Settlement of Muddy Creek, North Carolina, which is located in present day Forsyth County, North
2 CONC  Carolina.  There is a Dull Road in Lewisburg, North Carolina near the land where I settled.
2 CONT --------------------
