1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I was born in Erzweiler, Germany and baptized there at the Ulmet Reformed Church on January 3, 1707.  My first child, Johan Daniel Mack was born and baptized January 1, 1728.  When he was four, I married Johan Jaco
2 CONC b Mann on January 10, 1732 in Oberalben, Germany. We had two daughters and a son in Germany and later we all sailed for America on the ship "Glasgow". 
