1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I was born in Erzweiler, Ulmet Parish, Germany and baptized there on March 20,1713 at the Ulmet Reformed Church. I came to America with my widowed mother and siblings in 1738 aboard the ship "Glasgow".  I married P
2 CONC eter May March 30,1741 at St Paul's Red Hill Lutheran Church in Philadelphia County, Pennsylvania (it is now Montgomery County).
