1 NOTE {geni:about_me} There was a Peter Fuhrmann that was born bout 1688 in of Haschbach, Zweybrucken, Germany.  He died about 1730 in Maryland.  He was married to Anna Luise v on Ruehle and his parents were Johann Andreas Frommann born
2 CONC  in Coburg, Oberfranken, Bayern, Deutschland and Anna Tabitha Pregizer born in Tübingen, Württemberg, Deutschland.  This could be our Peter Froman.
