2 CONC otes:	 Note: Bergthal Gemeinde Buch, p. B309, states he was born 12 Jan 1845, but Bergthal Gemeinde Buch, p. A30, states he was born 12 Jun 1845. Die ersten mennonitischen Einwanderer in Paraguay, p. 56, states he was born 25 Jun 
2 CONC 1845. He migrated to Paraguay, arriving on the Voltaire in Buenos Aires in November, 1927. He left to return to Canada 5 Oct 1928. David died at sea, in the return passage from Paraguay to Canada (Doerksen, 1998, p. 63). It appear
2 CONC s from the Brot Schuld that he was earlier in Schoenthal, East Reserve, but according to the Preservings article, he got a Schoenhorst homestead at sw14-5-5E on 20 May 1880. He gained patent to that land on 14 Aug 1885. 1901 Canad
2 CONC a census says he was born 11 Jun 1845. See Preservings Jun 1998, p61 for an article on him. Birth Source: Preservings; Hanover-Steinbach Historical Society, magazine / newsletter, page Jun 1998, p61 Birth Source: Bergthal Gemeinde
