1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Smitham/Trevarthen in Smitham Clan Web Site:, managed by Thelma J. Smitham (Contact) Birth:	Sep 1 1835 - Rudnerweide, Molotschna, South Russia, Russia Death:	Nov 18 1907 - Ohrloff, Molotschna, South Russia, Russia 
2 CONC Wife:	Katharina Braeul (born Huebert) Children:	David [johann] Braeul, Agnes Braeul, Vera Braeul
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------
2 CONT
2 CONT Johann Braeul 
2 CONT #69625    
2 CONT Birth:	1 September, 1835,  Rudnerweide, Molotschna, South Russia
2 CONT Death:	18 November, 1907,  Ohrloff, Molotschna, South Russia
2 CONT Burial:	22 November, 1907    
2 CONT Father:	 Braeul, Jacob,  #69626, 9 November, 1803,  Burwalde, Chortitza, South Russia
2 CONT Mother:	 Penner, Elizabeth,  #69627, Abt 1802,  Klein Wickerau, Elbing, Prussia
2 CONT Family 1:
2 CONT Family #45477 	Spouse:  Huebert, Katharina,  #101279, 1 May, 1830,  Margenau, Molotschna, South Russia
2 CONT Married: October, 1853,  Margenau, Molotschna, South Russia
2 CONT 1 -- +  Braeul, Johannes,  #691036, 8 July, 1854,  Ohrloff, Molotschna, South Russia
2 CONT 2 -- +  Braeul, Jacob,  #693879, April, 1856 
2 CONT 3 -- +  Braeul, Lisett "Louise",  #691047, 1857,  Falz Fein's Estate
2 CONT 4 --     Braeul, Katharina,  #691050, 20 December, 1859 
2 CONT 5 --     Braeul, Mary,  #691057, 
2 CONT 6 --     Braun, Anna,  #691058, 
2 CONT 7 -- +  Braeul, David,  #69624, 8 September, 1861,  Ohrloff, Molotschna, South Russia
2 CONT 8 -- +  Braeul, Peter,  #691056, 10 August, 1862,  Halbstadt, Molotschna, South Russia
2 CONT 9 --     Braeul, Heinrich,  #691054, 23 August, 1865,  Ohrloff, Molotschna, South Russia
