2 CONT Note: Kauenhowen 2 DGB p. 344: "Aeltester zu..." He was never an Aeltester (Bishop) - that was his father. According to the Bergthal Colony church register he became a deacon in the Bergthal colony congregation on 10 Mar 1849 and 
2 CONC left that position in 1851. A copy of his handwritten family register can be found in the Mennonite Heritage Archives, Winnipeg, MB, Vol. 5222.
