1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Note: There are conflicting birth dates for Johann Neufeld everything in the record matches except for the birth date. The alternate birth date is found in the Bergthal Gemeinde Buch, which is Mach 11, 1833 and Mar
2 CONC ch 11, 1834. The Birth date posted is from the Sommerfeld Gemeinde Buch. I am certain that this is the same Johann Neufeld, as all other names and dates line up.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes on Immigration: Johann (40 at the time) immigrated to Canada with his wife and children. The ship's name that they travelled on was S.S. Nova Scotian No. 46. The ship arrived in Quebec on July 27, 1874.
