2 CONC  Feb 1918), Find a Grave Memorial ID 221934334, citing Greenfarm Mennonite Brethren Church Cemetery, Morse, Moose Jaw Census Division, Saskatchewan, Canada; Maintained by Linda (contributor 47353767).
