2 CONC incorrectly given as Anna in one of her entries in the March to May, 1814 Vaccination List. The photocopy of an old family document affirms that her name was Susanna, and that she was a daughter of Peter Pries of Chortitz. The Sha
2 CONC ron D. Sawatzky submission says she was born 8 Sept 1812 and died 24 Apr 1893 in Friesenfeld, South Fussia. The Sawatzky Genealogy 1760-1980 compiled by helen C. Andres 1980 page 1 gives Susanna's birthdate as 1815 and immigrated 
