2 CONC  Children:	Liese Funk, John R. Funk, Herman R. Funk, Ezra R. Funk, David Funk, Menno Funk, Marie Funk, Theodore R. Funk, Alvin R. Funk, Peter R. Funk, Leonard R. Funk Adds: birth date, birth place, death date, death place, occupat
