2 CONT Notes:  HS-129*. His n.s. birth date was 1 May 1868. Franz and his family were in the third group of immigrants from Manitoba to Puerto Casado. Their trip took from 20 Dec 1926 to 24 Jan 1927 (Giesbrecht, 1994, p. 26). They arrive
