1 NAME Heinrich F. /Reimer/
2 GIVN Heinrich F.
2 SURN Reimer
2 _MARNM Reimer
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 2 SEP 1845
2 PLAC Ukraine, Russia
2 ADDR
1 BAPM
2 DATE 1864
1 BURI
2 DATE MAR 1900
2 PLAC Church of God in Christ Mennonite Church Cemetery
2 ADDR
3 ADR1 Memorial ID  177687902
3 CITY Kleefeld, East Reserve, Manitoba, Canada
1 DEAT
2 DATE 24 MAR 1900
2 PLAC Gruenfeld Road, Kleefeld, Manitoba, Canada
2 ADDR
1 OCCU
1 TITL Rev
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Immigrated July 17/1874  S. S. Austrian arrived Quebec City, Quebec
2 CONT
2 CONT Heinrich F. Reimer married his second cousin, Katharina Sawatzky. He settled in Blumenort, Manitoba, in 1874, where his semlin (sod dugout) was used as the school house during the first winter. He was elected as minister of the Kl
2 CONC eine Gemeinde in Blumenort, Manitoba on January 22, 1876. He joined with John Holdeman when a large group left the Kleine Gemeinde in 1882 and did not serve as a minister after that. In 1888, after the death of his first wife, he 
2 CONC married Susanna Ratzlaff, widow of Rev. Abraham Loewen and moved to Grunfeld (Kleefeld).
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 2 Sep 1845, South Russia
2 CONT
2 CONT Baptism: 1864
2 CONT
2 CONT Immigration: 17 Jul 1874, S. S. Austrian; arrived Quebec City, Quebec
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 24 Mar 1900, Rural Municipality of Hanover, Manitoba
2 CONT
2 CONT 1st marriage:  Sawatzky, Katharina, 6 Oct 1846, Married: 10 Feb 1865; Russia
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT 1 Reimer, Katharina, 10 Mar 1866
2 CONT 2 Reimer, Margaretha, 24 Aug 1874
2 CONT 3 Reimer, Heinrich, 25 Sep 1876
2 CONT 4 Reimer, Maria S., 27 Nov 1878
2 CONT
2 CONT 2nd marriage:  Ratzlaff, Susanna, 18 Sep 1846, Married: 25 Dec 1888; Rural Municipality of Hanover, Manitoba
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:
2 CONT Father: Reimer, Heinrich, 8 Feb 1818
2 CONT Mother: Friesen, Helena, 15 Jul 1823
2 CONT
2 CONT Note:  Was the first minister to be elected by the East Reserv Mennonite Kleine Gemeinde at a Ministerial Election held on Jan. 22, 1876.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/177687902/heinrich-f-reimer Find A Grave Me
2 CONC morial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Nov 27 2023, 17:26:06 UTC''
