2 CONT EMB minister-first minister of the Bruderthaler Church of Steinbach, Man in 1898.  Moved to Hamilton Co NE Aug 6 1891.  Moved to CO Mar 7 1893.  Moved from Texas to Man  Nov 16 1898.  Moved from Man to Sask in 1905.  Moved from La
2 CONC ngam Sask to Dallas OR on Dec 1 1912.  Moved to American Falls ID Jun 15 1915. Then moved back to Dallas OR.
