2 CONT Notes:	 Note: Profile of the Mennonite Kleine Gemeinde, p. 275 gives the date of her marriage to Friesen as 8 May 1860. Her first name is given as Margaret on the ship passenger list in 1877, which is apparently incorrect. Plett b
