1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Looking for descendants of Peter Epp #1336034 and Maria Jacob _____ #1336035. I believe most of the descendants are now living in NRW Germany.
2 CONT
2 CONT Reason being is that I believe Peter Epp #1336034 is the same person as Peter Epp #426877 and Maria Jacob ____ #1336035 is the same person as Maria Isaak #58823 whose father is Jacob Isaac #3913.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob Isaac #3913 had written a letter to the Die Mennonitische Rundschau on 19 March 1902, pg. 5 column 4. My translation of it says with my changes in brackets: “My children … are all married. Daughter Maria [Isaac #58823 marrie
2 CONC d] a Peter Epp [#426877], formerly of Alexanderthal, now lives in [Samara Province] and has 40 desi. of land.” That letter puts Maria in Samara with her husband, Peter Epp.
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria Jacob ____ #1336035 & Peter Epp #1336034 are buried in Klinok, Neu Samara, Russia and their children are all born in there as well.
2 CONT
2 CONT I am also looking to see if any of the descendants have done a DNA test so that we can see if we match and then we could connect the two families.
2 CONT
2 CONT Any help is most appreciated.
