2 NICK Margaretha
2 NICK Drum
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 30 JUN 1716
2 ADDR
3 CITY Ulmet
3 STAE Kurpfalz
3 CTRY Heiliges Römisches Reich Deutscher Nation
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1779
2 ADDR
3 CITY Moore Township
3 STAE Pennsylvania
3 CTRY United States
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I was born near Erzweiler, Germany and came to America on August 30,1737 with my husband and two small children Casper who was two and Catherine who was six months old. Our son Casper died shortly after our arrival
2 CONC  in Pennsylvania.  In Pennsylvania, we hadsix more children : Leonard, Christian, Casper, John, Abraham, and Elizabeth. After my husband Christian died, I married Lewis Erb and we returned to Moore Township in Northampton county w
2 CONC here Christian's land was patented by Lewis on November 6,1776.
2 CONT --------------------
