1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Catharina "Catherine" Dull was six months old when they left Germany on the ship Samuel.  She and Frederick Hesser moved from Philadelphia Co to Montgomery Co, Pennsylvania before 1760 when the threat of Indian att
2 CONC acks was still a serious consideration
