1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I settled in Plainfield Township, Northampton Co, Pennsylvania where I took up a large tract of land.  I am recorded as an ensign in Colonel Arthur Sinclairs Second Pennsylvania Battalion of the Continental Line an
2 CONC d served in the Canada Campaign of 1776.  I was a man of prominence and influence in the notable events following the struggle for our independence.
