1 NOTE {geni:about_me} i lived at the Spring House Tavern near Trappe, Pennsylvania. I was a soldier and commanded a company in Colonel John Moore's Battalion of Philadelphia County Associators, which was in service at Brandywine and Ger
2 CONC mantown, Pennsylvania.  My wife and I are buried in Lot 35, Grave 3 in the Old Section of the Germantown Church of the Brethren Cemetery next to the Quaker Meeting House., Philadelphia Co, Pennsylvania
