2 CONT "Other members of the Reformed Church were neighbor Doll
2 CONT and his family. Johannes and Elizabeth Doll were the parents
2 CONT of Hanna, who was baptized by the Pastor. They sold meal
2 CONT to him and secured medicine from him. Caspar Doll sent soup
2 CONT and meat to the parsonage."  > https://hsmcpa.org/images/thebulletin/1968vol16no3.pdf page `149
2 CONT
2 CONT see <journals> project as well
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
