1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Leonhardt Weissinger was born 20 Dec 1727 in Kircheim, Wurtemberg, Germany, and died 3 Feb 1799 in Kircheim. He married  Agnes Dorothea Scheiffele, 15 Jul 1749 in Kircheim. She was born 11 Apr 1730 in Kircheim and 
2 CONC died 3 Sep 1807 Kircheim.  Her father was Michael Scheiffele, who was born 1690.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children were:
2 CONT # Charles
2 CONT # Michael, died 1811
2 CONT # Elizabetha, maried unknown Faber in 1828
2 CONT # Barbara
2 CONT # Leonhardt Jr. born 1750/1770 Weilheim, Wurtemburg and died after 1828
2 CONT # John,  born 16 Mar 1758 Wertheim, Wurtenburg, and died 20 Nov 1809 in SC. He was buried  Nov 1809 Old Lutheran Cemetary, Charleston, SC. He married Anna Magdalena Gutjahren, 14 Mar 1786 Charleston, SC.
2 CONT # Jacob,  born 1 Sep 1761 Kircheim, Wurtemberg (?), died 12 Aug 1823, Germany.
2 CONT # George Sr., born 6 Jul 1769 Weilheim, Wurtenburg, and died 20 Apr 1837 Perry Co., AL. He was buried on plantation, Perry Co., AL. He married Winifred Aanderson, 30 Jun 1792 Richmond Co., GA. She was born 28 Sep 1777 Newbern, (or
2 CONC  Newberne), NC
