2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Johann migrated from Steinhardtwald, Bavaria, Germany, on the ship Loui sa, sailing from Rotterdam and arriving at Philadelphia, PA on 7 Nov 17 52. The voyage had been a long and perilous one, and many of the passen gers had died 
2 CONC on the way. Among these was his first wife.  He was marri ed three times. Margaretha was his second wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Gabriel Swartzlander was born in 1694 at Westheim, Bayern, Germany and d ied in 1742
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Christina Schein was born in 1698 at Westheim, Bayern, Germany and d ied in 1752
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT
