1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Abraham (Abram) Braun is the father of Jacob Braun with his 1st wife Katharina Klippenstein Braun (born Geisbrecht), Jacob married Elizabeth Seimens and had Jacob (Jack) Brown (born Braun) who married Justina Dueck
2 CONC  (Dyck) and had a daughter Elsie. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Abraham (Abram) Braun and his 2nd wife Katharina Braun Enns (born Heinrichs) are the father of Aganetha (Agnes) Braun who married George Feakes and Elsie married their son Irving Feakes.
2 CONT
2 CONT This creates an interesting relation description when it comes to connections of family members between the step siblings and adopted siblings from the 2 Klippenstein children Abraham adopted and the natural Braun children from Ab
2 CONC raham's 2 marriages.
