1 NOTE {geni:about_me} MEADE - Helen Zielke, 98, died Aug. 30, 1993, at Schowalter Villa, Hesston.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born Nov. 19, 1894, at McPherson, the daughter of Jacob and Maria Regehr Warkentin. A longtime Meade resident, she was a homemaker.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was a charter member of the Evangelical Mennonite Brethren Church, Meade.
2 CONT
2 CONT On Sept. 3, 1918, she married Abe A. Zeilke, at Meade. He died July 30, 1959.
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral service will be 11 a.m Thursday, at Evangelical Mennonite Brethren Church with the Rev. Paul Boeker presiding. Friends may call from 9 a.m. to 9 p.m. Wednesday, at Fidler-Orme Mortuary, Meade. Burial will be at the EMB Chu
