0 @N6000000001869722791@ NOTE One family record says she was born 2 Feb and died in 1855. Schapansky indicates that Helena died on 30 June 1859 (1992, p. 118). Isaak Bergen states that she died Jan. 30, 1855 in Rosenthal, Chortitza Colony.
0 @N6000000001869722811@ NOTE Her name is written as Agata. One record says she was born 1 Sep 1842. The Schoenhorst register (p. 14) states that she moved to Rosenthal.
0 @N6000000001869722831@ NOTE The Helga Enns submission says she was born 19 Sept 1842. Anna died of typhus (Klippenstein, 1994). Rempel Tree (obtained from Margaret Ewert) shows Anna was born in Eichenfeld and married in Rosenthal, Chortitza. The Vincent Remp
1 CONC el submission says she was born 19 Sept 1843 at Rosenthal, Chortitza. The Schoenhorst register (p. 14) states that she moved to Nikolaifeld.
0 @N6000000001869722851@ NOTE One family record says she was born in 1842. The Schoenhorst register (p. 14) states that she moved to Gruenfeld.
